    {
      "tr": "`@app.get(\"/counter\")` ve `@app.post(\"/counter\")`; POST'ta `state[\"count\"] += 1`.",
      "en": "`@app.get(\"/counter\")` and `@app.post(\"/counter\")`; in POST `state[\"count\"] += 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\nstate = {\"count\": 0}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/counter\")\ndef read_counter():\n    return state\n\n\n@app.post(\"/counter\")\ndef increase():\n    state[\"count\"] += 1\n    return state\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\nstate = {\"count\": 0}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/counter\")\ndef read_counter():\n    return state\n\n\n@app.post(\"/counter\")\ndef increase():\n    state[\"count\"] += 1\n    return state\n```"
    }
  ],
